# reduced-open (SettingsMenu.module.css's prefers-reduced-motion): under reduced motion the panel
# only fades, 120 ms in and out, and keeps its place; the list's new content fades in over 120 ms.
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 1383 48
frames opening every 16 for 144
wait 300
move 1250 181
click 1251 129
frames swap every 16 for 144
wait 300
key Escape
frames closing every 16 for 144
